<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>

<section xml:id="runestone-02" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Section 02: Accessing Runestone Academy</title>

  <p>
    Begin by going to
    <url href="https://landing.runestone.academy">
      https://landing.runestone.academy
    </url>.
  </p>

  <p>
    If you do <alert>not</alert> have a Runestone account, follow
    these instructions.
    <ul>
      <li>
        <p>
          Click “Register and Get Started”
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Under "Student in a class," click the button for "Sign up
          &amp; Join”
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          This will take you to a page that allows you to pick a
          username, password, enter name, email, etc.
          <ol>
            <li>
              <p>
                Please use your real first and last name; you can use
                any email and username you want.
              </p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p>
                Use "(your university’s full name)" for the
                institution.
              </p>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </p>
      </li>

      <li>
        <p>
          Save your username and password somewhere.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li>
        <p>
          Do NOT select that you are an instructor and want to create
          a course.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Click on "Create Account."
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          When it asks for a donation, select "Sorry, not today."
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          On the next page, enter your course name:
          GVSU-MTH202-02-Fall-26.
        </p>
        <p>
          While there may be another option to select the course from
          a list, don’t use that option.  Again, just enter the course
          name as above.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Scroll all the way down and click "Enroll"
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </p>

  <p>
    If you <alert>do</alert> already have a Runestone account, log in,
    use the person
    icon go to the user menu and select “Change Course.”
    <ul>
      <li>
        <p>
          Then scroll down if needed and choose “Enroll in Another
          Course.”
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Enter the course name: GVSU-MTH-202-02-Fall-26.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Scroll all the way down and click "Enroll"
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </p>

</section>
